  description: '"One of the knights, he is equipped with "BFS Armor", which is made
    of a dense steel carefully refined at the factory, and "Foil-Packer", a special
    mechanism that can be converted into various weapons depending on the state of
    combat, thanks to it being linked with the highly analytical "Coc-OS". Although
    "Hamburk" is equipped with the usual suite of equipment, he is incredibly popular
    thanks to his combat style being extremely high calorie. His power is further
    enhanced by the blessings of the goddess "Madera"."'
